# The deployed worker. Baked into the bundle at build time, so it is public by
# design and belongs in the repo.
#
# Its own name under the site's domain, not `workers.dev`: the session cookie
# only travels between addresses that share a registrable domain, so a page on
# `alba.bertinilabs.xyz` talking to `bertinis-vault.bertinisdnd.workers.dev`
# can store builds but can never hold an account. The Worker answers to both
# names, and every module already installed keeps asking the old one.
VITE_VAULT_URL=https://api.bertinilabs.xyz
